ref "/athletes/60207"} "Bohumil Kubát"] " in round three, which ended in another draw. After three rounds six wrestlers remained. Kubát and Bohdan fought to a draw, while Dietrich won his match by fall over Bulgarian " [:a {:href "/athletes/57420"} "Radoslav Kasabov"] ". Bohdan, Dietrich and Kubát survived but no final round was necessary as they had all wrestled each other, all three matches ending in draws. Bohdan won the gold medal based on total bad points, as he won his other two matches by falls. Dietrich and Kubát tied with 5 bad points with Dietrich winning the silver medal based on lower bodyweight than Kubát. In fact, Kubát outweighed Dietrich by 40 kg (88 lbs.)."] "\n"] [:table {:class "table table-striped"} [:thead {} [:tr {} [:th {} "Pos"] [:th {} "Competitor"] [:th {} "NOC"] [:th {}] [:th {}] [:th {}]]] [:tbody {} [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "1"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/60455"} "Ivan Bogdan"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/URS"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/URS.png"}] "URS"]] [:td {} [:span {:class "Gold"} "Gold"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "2"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/58341"} "Wilfried Dietrich"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/GER"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/GER.png"}] "GER"]] [:td {} [:span {:class "Silver"} "Silver"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "3"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/60207"} "Bohumil Kubát"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/TCH"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/TCH.png"}] "TCH"]] [:td {} [:span {:class "Bronze"} "Bronze"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "4"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/58599"} "István Kozma"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/HUN"} [:img {:style "paddin